b1d-f422fa01db81.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":20,"rental_id":250762,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:08.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:08.000000Z"},{"id":4936504,"path":"https://res-3.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1762416250/5dhm_dafc995f-b968-46bf-a7db-f472268e3805.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":21,"rental_id":250762,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:08.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:08.000000Z"}],"image":{"id":4936480,"path":"https://res-4.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1762415619/5dhm_319163ce-6700-4eb4-b6e3-891be8bb8be6.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":1,"rental_id":250762,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:08.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:11:08.000000Z"},"reviews":[{"id":5894062,"review":"..","rental_id":250762,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:57.000000Z"},{"id":5903438,"review":"I’ve stayed in hundreds of Airbnbs around the world and this was by far the worst experience I’ve ever had. Before booking, I asked for early check-in as a courtesy due to my 6:30 AM flight. The host refused unless I paid for an extra night, which I did. After a long flight I arrived exhausted, only to be locked outside in freezing rain for almost an hour because the security guard had locked both of us out. The host was unreachable the entire time.\n\nOnce inside, the master bathroom sink had a major leak and was unusable until the next day. The bed frame was broken, causing the mattress to sink to the floor every time I laid down, and I had to constantly fix it myself. The WiFi details in the listing didn’t even exist and I had to wait for someone to come set it up. Even getting in and out of the building was stressful — you have to keep getting parking passes from the front desk every time you leave.\n\nThis place was a complete joke and honestly felt like a scam.","rental_id":250762,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5914228,"review":"everything was great ❤️","rental_id":250762,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z"},{"id":5914864,"review":"highly recommend 👍👍","rental_id":250762,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z"},{"id":5923978,"review":"Abbiamo trovato qualche difficoltà il primo giorno, il letto con doghe rotte e uno dei due bagni con lavabo inutilizzabile per perdita acqua, ma sono stati subito riparati quindi efficienza.\nL’appartamento é molto grande,  spazioso, confortevole e molto bello. L’assistenza sempre molto disponibile e gentile a qualsiasi ora del giorno o notte.\nSe dovessi ritornare al Cairo tornerei in questo alloggio, quindi lo consiglio vivamente!\nGrazie","rental_id":250762,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":6091667,"review":"Overall I give 5 STARS!!! ⭐️ ⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ I flew in the middle of the night and it made finding the exact place challenging, although in reality, it is not hard to find! But the driver must have SPECIFIC written instructions. This is a GREAT location! Very safe, very spacious, very affordable and convenient. Xuru Stays has very friendly staff always ready to serve and help with kindness. I had some issues with the plumbing and they sent the plumber to fix immediately as well as clean towels. Anything you need they will help with quickly! It was not completely spotless but I also recognize we are in the desert and they are doing new construction outside the complex! If you have an issue, be confident that Xuru will help you, no matter what. This is worth so much! I would MOST DEFINITELY stay here again and I recommend it! THANK YOU XURU STAYS! ❤️","rental_id":250762,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z"},{"id":6162110,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":250762,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}